:null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-15T17:13:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T16:00:17Z","closed_at":"2025-03-17T15:59:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104187","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104187.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104187.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-17T15:59:13Z"},"body":"I profiled the launch of tps-demo. I noticed a substantial contributor to performance was `FileAccessCompressed::get_buffer` at 1.6%.\r\n\r\nI optimized the function by using `memcpy` to copy over whole blocks instead of iterating through bytes one by one.\r\nThis brought down its contribution during launch by about 8x:\r\n```\r\n98.80 Mc   1,6 %\t-\t  FileAccessCompressed::get_buffer(unsigned char*, unsigned long long) const\r\n```\r\n```\r\n8.29 Mc   0,1 %\t-\t   FileAccessCompressed::get_buffer(unsigned char*, unsigned long long) const (from `memmove`)\r\n7.05 Mc   0,1 %\t-\t  FileAccessCompressed::get_buffer(unsigned char*, unsigned long long) const (from self-time)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe implementation should probably be double checked, but I did test tps-demo still launched fine.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nThe function could be further optimized by reading to the input buffer directly. That would require somewhat of a rewrite of the function though, because it needs to account for overreading, and wouldn't benefit the speed by as much a margin as this PR does. So I didn't bother.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104187/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104187/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}